    "title": "How Much Does It Cost to Move to Dubai?",
    "excerpt": "One-off setup costs to move to Dubai run roughly AED 45k-70k for a single person, AED 90k-160k a couple and AED 200k+ a family.",
    "category": "Buyer Guides",
